    "summary": "When an enemy selects its Fight phase targets, pick a friendly DEATHWING unit among them. Roll a D6 each time it loses a model in that phase while it still awaits selection to fight. Add 1 if an enemy engaging your unit is close enough to be in range of the objective you vowed to take. A 4+ leaves the casualty in play through its unit’s fight, or through the close of the phase if that comes sooner.",
